# ARCH: feat-1-per-cu-itr-directories
# TIMESTAMP: 2026-10-09

Hexagonal architecture: domain models in itrcompiler.domain.models; compile
orchestration in itrcompiler.application.services; CLI parsing in
itrcompiler.control.cli; filesystem access only via
itrcompiler.infrastructure.filesystem. No cross-layer dependencies. Port
flow outbound to inbound. New validation failures must be typed domain
errors surfaced with the offending CU id and component name.
